{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "358d1c4f39ca256a3d4bdda31467084a8bdde22d80f6e1fe732ebab8b2c1055d", "ja": "仕事で海外ロケに行く事になった\n『夜想令嬢』のメンバー。飛行機を待つ間、\n『昏き星、遠い月』の舞台のモデルとなった\n場所を訪れる楽しみや、買い物などに思いを\n馳せつつ、おしゃべりに花を咲かせる。", "zh": "《夜想令嬢》的成员们因为工作要去海外取景。在等待飞机的同时，她们一边畅想着参观作为《昏暗之星，遥远之月》舞台原型的地方、购物等乐趣，一边聊得热火朝天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1000_046rio", "source_sha256": "da9cdc0949b608313fad7943314a3da1d989be387e49e24c058257d4b1df33bc", "ja": "みんな、手続きしてきたわよ～！\nあとは……搭乗時間を待つだけね♪", "zh": "大家，我办好手续回来啦～！\n接下来……只要等登机时间就行了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "36b1cf05911a28e48654a0df7cc0d183698a75451b9d9b78290cbba0564d7f47", "ja": "うう～、ドキドキしてきた～！　だって海外だよ！？\n『夜想令嬢』で海外ロケとか、楽しみだよね、千鶴！", "zh": "呜呜～，好紧张啊～！毕竟是要去海外哦！？\n《夜想令嬢》要去海外出外景什么的，真让人期待呢，千鹤！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "e42b155281cf28a3a5b1ff581b21f8c625d90bd7645a9bdd28f622f8ed5d634d", "ja": "えっ？　ええ、そうですわね。\nわたくしも、とても楽しみですわ！", "zh": "诶？嗯嗯，确实如此呢。\n我也非常期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "89c75accbbcf23f994250af838559ab73025a545d95fb3c8bf881988970633b9", "ja": "アタシなんて、昨日からテンション上がっちゃって\nさー。　えっと、忘れ物とかしてないよね？", "zh": "我可是从昨天开始就兴奋起来了——呃，应该没忘带什么东西吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "69c9a81bf508050461e60bca089069af90141ceadd2182f4e5f9faabd87b8c79", "ja": "化粧水のミストなら、ちゃんと持ってきたわよ。\n機内は乾燥するっていうから、保湿しないと♪", "zh": "如果是化妆水喷雾，我当然带来了。\n听说机舱里很干燥，不保湿可不行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "a442a23bd3c4c6b0f253dfe1d15aaa39b48a771bc7e36ee88bd6ad776dc752c4", "ja": "ええっ、化粧水！？\nそんなの、スーツケースの中に入れてきちゃったよ～！", "zh": "诶诶，化妆水！？\n我把那种东西放进旅行箱里带来了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "83a1c0066adc41bb8b0b85f59bad835d6cc9956dc23b458670d4ec33ecca1a85", "ja": "……千鶴、さっきからなんか静かだね？\nもしかして……。", "zh": "……千鹤，你从刚才起好像就很安静呢？\n难道说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "2a8ac31a6d3d3c1e532a4838af969616ce40139dfbbe845d79c5bedf3d32b0f9", "ja": "飛行機、苦手とか？　にゃはは！", "zh": "你是不擅长坐飞机之类的吗？喵哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "159a1e38de46a0a51ec6bc8e87d8034dbfaa3ece20cb7ded9ff5b1c814f7bfcf", "ja": "そっ……そうですわね！　ひ、飛行機は、\nあまり得意ではなくて……でも、大丈夫ですわ！", "zh": "对……对呢！飞、飞机我不太在行……不过，没问题的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "df0d82341d2be150c659dceaba1af2c69f5aac46c26e852cc6c419006951919b", "ja": "海外旅行なんて、セレブにとっては近所を散歩する\nようなものですから！　オーッホッホッホッ、ゲホッ！", "zh": "海外旅行这种事，对名媛来说就像在附近散步一样！哦呵呵呵呵……咳、咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "e6a347ca6e2ab3cbd6e060c2d77d6dfa81a5b33373cb4447da8e3ddad4b407ad", "ja": "とはいえ、今回はプライベートではなく、お仕事……\nなので、きっちり準備をしてまいりましてよ！", "zh": "话虽如此，这次不是私人旅行，而是工作……所以，我可是做足了充分的准备才来的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "4c679a1e367f63204211583f83ef108928d42e4d283651d9e9282d60bdb3dc16", "ja": "うふふ、頼もしい限りですね～。\nでは、今回のロケ地のことも……？", "zh": "呵呵，真是太可靠了～\n那么，关于这次的外景拍摄地也……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "54a50c656dfb365233b78d434ccb074daa82dae21f58c972843983bb68f8583a", "ja": "もちろん、予習してありますわ！　今回わたくしたちが\n訪れるのは、『昏き星、遠い月』の物語の舞台……。", "zh": "当然，我已经提前做过功课了！这次我们要去的地方，是《昏暗之星，遥远之月》的故事舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "db4e0e444a266ba5a6df4339170840fb91ea238c437066c8180341d7ade6fffc", "ja": "公演のことを思い出しながら、縁のありそうな地を、\nひとつひとつ調べておきましたの！", "zh": "我一边回忆着公演，一边把似乎与之有缘的地方都逐一调查过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "fb0afedc2eb01406f2a89a192ffc90d983c1921f084f43924bbea8fc7a3c90f7", "ja": "千鶴ちゃん、なんてえらいの……！\nまだ時間もあるし、私たちも確認しておきましょうか♪", "zh": "千鹤真了不起……！\n时间还充裕，我们也确认一下吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "e1ae3ac3419f3f753d6ad5e8ae97bae5e2f1b56a67e599c3ffb82b8d78ad02ac", "ja": "えっと、最初は……あっ、見てみて、朋花！\nクリスとエドガーが出会った場所だって！", "zh": "那个，首先是……啊，快看，朋花！\n这里就是克里斯和埃德加相遇的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "3226cba2a75348cc3f48a9848221308bea57dbdc6e5bd6c67f8b3a00a26f0c23", "ja": "旅の始まりが、ふたりの出会いの場所だなんて……\nなんだかロマンティックですね～、ふふっ。", "zh": "旅途的起点竟然是两人相遇的地方……总觉得好浪漫啊～呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "695d41c12d1b22b2a04c0d5358e125db27bca4bb4fd260d8ade0fcd6daecc2ab", "ja": "お芝居には、セットがありましたが……こうして\n実際に見に行けるなんて、なんだかうれしいですね～。", "zh": "戏剧里有布景，不过……能像这样亲自去看看，总觉得很开心呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "0cf358e2f04787ea9b9500ef48da505239f8fc465583018ef2c4f7c2dee3b147", "ja": "そだね！　でもさ、実物なんか見ちゃったら……\nアタシ、感動して泣いちゃうかも～！", "zh": "对呀！不过要是看到实物的话……我可能会感动得哭出来哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "0a0aacecd09d456fe8841e4fe1298986abb75a3d93352426f9502561fedc616c", "ja": "その次が、私……エレオノーラが暮らすお城！\n……の、モデルになった場所ね！", "zh": "接下来就是我……埃莉奥诺拉居住的城堡！  \n……的原型所在地啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1022_046rio", "source_sha256": "02a6d2680122a565622a494bdfd7283808531f48440c984be7c5329088c93993", "ja": "写真でも、うっとりするくらいステキだったけど……\nそうね、私も泣いちゃいそう。ウフフ♪", "zh": "光看照片就美得让人陶醉，不过……是啊，我也快要哭出来了。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "7dac952e3fa369b68e42819a23fe055c760f61ce2466f89336feb79eedf54b1b", "ja": "エレオノーラのように妖艶な雰囲気のお城でしたが、\n実際はきっと、素晴らしいお城なのでしょうね～。", "zh": "那是一座拥有如埃莉奥诺拉般妖艳氛围的城堡，不过实际上一 定也是座无比华美的城堡吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "04c97cf7e634a642239d4e0d339ac3802b4ce150f29782a49069cc8640907e86", "ja": "さすが朋花ちゃん、わかってるわね！\n私もいつか、あんなお城に住んでみたいわ～。", "zh": "不愧是朋花，真懂我呢！我也想有一天住进那样的城堡呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1025_031tom", "source_sha256": "19108d189bf1b361f71c50fac4dd2e7ac1de04fa768122abee6a593f4eec9b56", "ja": "そういえば、古城をホテルにしているという話を\n聞いたことがあります～。千鶴さん、ご存知ですか～？", "zh": "说起来，我听说过有把古城改成酒店的地方～。千鹤小姐，您知道吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1026_038chz", "source_sha256": "4be1165fe7c05aa3121449c198d489e2b0dc442fd67762163915e7a0ebc2f0df", "ja": "も、もちろん、知っていましてよ！\n荘厳なお城に見事な調度品、そして美しい庭園……。", "zh": "当、当然知道了！\n庄严的城堡、精美的陈设家具，还有美丽的庭园……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1027_038chz", "source_sha256": "adf4fe43d77407a682bc60af8121dad65c9f478c5f8fa7b3a731bd09d8cba4fa", "ja": "ですが、どのホテルにも違った魅力がありますもの。\nわたくしたちのホテルも、きっと素敵だと思いますわ！", "zh": "不过，每家酒店都有各自不同的魅力嘛。\n我们的酒店也一定很棒呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "d3916acd7e8ce8464eeeb2be1a8b1d6911d6800d486f52de52621caa7efb7578", "ja": "おおー……。\nなんか千鶴が言うと、めっちゃ説得力あるね♪", "zh": "哦哦……。\n感觉千鹤这么一说，就特别有说服力呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1029_031tom", "source_sha256": "0f7be2e2700f77878663d0b40d0252d41eddd4ad2ff08fd7aa50b75912eb3ae6", "ja": "そうですね～。千鶴さんのおかげで、\n海外でも、問題なく過ごせそうですね～。", "zh": "是呀～多亏了千鹤小姐，看来在海外也能平安无事地度过了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_001_gn_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_001_gn_01_1030_031tom", "source_sha256": "705a1aeca4c5052d5d5e73cce4e3946c45b54434a5a9c55f66c58e869909829d", "ja": "あとは……いい子でお留守番している子豚ちゃん\nたちに、何かごほうびを考えなくては～。", "zh": "剩下的……就得为乖乖看家的小猪仔们，\n想想该给什么奖励了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
